---
import GameLayout from "../../../layouts/GameLayout.astro";
---

<GameLayout title="OverTheWire: Vortex Level 26" gameName="vortex" level={26}>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-normal text-neutral-500 mt-6 mb-2">
        Create your own challenges
    </h2>

    <div class="p-4 mb-4 bg-[#E0E0E0] border-l-4 border-[#A0A0A0] text-black">
        <p class="font-bold">Vortex is complete</p>
        <p>
            This description is kept for historical reasons, but should not be
            followed. We are no longer expanding Vortex with new levels.
        </p>
    </div>

    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Due to the overwhelming flood of new levels, vortex26 shall be to make a
        level, along with exploit, and email it to andrewg.
    </p>
</GameLayout>
